- If you do not specify this parameter, the default value `["auto"]` is used.

> The following cases cause an error:<br>- More than 5 ratios are specified.<br>- An empty list is passed.<br>- The ratio contains non-integer values, such as `4.1:3`.<br>- The ratio value is less than 0.5 or greater than 2.', example='["1:1"]', position='Query'),
