The OSS URI follows the format oss://${Bucket}/${Object}, where `${Bucket}` is the name of an OSS bucket in the same region as the current project, and `${Object}` is the full path of the file including the file name extension.', example='oss://examplebucket/sampleobject.mp4', position='Query'),
}

